        "original_id": "1b88f07f-855a-579b-bf87-725ade6c0f60",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Dharmatma\n- Places: Teheran, Afghanistan, New York Cotton Exchange\n- People: Ratan Khatri\n- Concepts: Matka, satta, lottery\n\nFacts:\n- Dharmatma is a 1975 Hindi thriller movie.\n- Dharmatma was the first Bollywood film to be shot in Teheran, Afghanistan.\n- The title character of Dharmatma was based on Ratan Khatri.\n- Ratan Khatri was known as the matka king.\n- Matka, also called satta, is a form of lottery.\n- Matka originally involved betting on the opening and closing rates of cotton transmitted from the New York Cotton Exchange.",
